<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main id="main-content">
  <section class="sh-page-hero" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">
    <div class="sh-container">
      <span class="sh-hero__tag">Need to Know</span>
      <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
      <p>Clear answers about our capabilities, project intake, manufacturing processes, and how we work with clients.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sh-section" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
    <div class="sh-container" style="max-width:920px;">
      <div class="sh-section-title">
        <span style="display:inline-block;color:var(--sh-brand);font-size:var(--sh-text-xs);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">Common Questions</span>
        <h2 id="faq-heading">Answers before you start.</h2>
        <p>If your question is not here, send us the project details and we will point you in the right direction.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sh-card" style="padding:var(--sh-space-4) var(--sh-space-8);">
        <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate"><button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">What industries do you serve?</button><div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>We serve Agriculture, Automobile, Medical, Oil & Gas, and Home & Office industries. Our manufacturing capabilities can be adapted to the specific requirements of each sector.</p></div></div>
        <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate"><button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">What manufacturing technologies do you use?</button><div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>Our four core technologies are 3D Printing, Laser Cutting, CNC Punching, and Plasma Cutting. We select the appropriate process based on material, geometry, tolerance, quantity, and required outcome.</p></div></div>
        <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate"><button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">How do I request a quote?</button><div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>Use our online quote form, email info@sharehubseng.com, or call +234 913 511 6716. Include dimensions, material, quantity, intended use, and any drawings or references you have. We aim to respond within 24 hours.</p></div></div>
        <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate"><button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">What is your typical turnaround time?</button><div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>Turnaround depends on the process, material, quantity, complexity, and current workload. We provide a realistic delivery timeline with each quote rather than promising a generic lead time.</p></div></div>
        <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate"><button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">Do you offer design and engineering support?</button><div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>Yes. Our consultancy service covers design review, feasibility analysis, material selection, process optimisation, and product development. We use engineering software including SolidWorks, AutoCAD, and ANSYS.</p></div></div>
        <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate"><button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">What file formats do you accept?</button><div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>For 3D printing and CNC work, STEP, STL, and IGES are preferred. For 2D cutting, DXF and DWG are useful. If you only have a sketch, image, or physical sample, contact us and we can advise on the next step.</p></div></div>
        <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate"><button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">Do you work with individuals or only companies?</button><div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>Both. We support industrial businesses, startups, organisations, and individuals with projects ranging from prototypes and custom parts to repeat production.</p></div></div>
        <div class="sh-faq-item sh-animate" style="border-bottom:0;"><button class="sh-faq-item__question" aria-expanded="false">Where are you located?</button><div class="sh-faq-item__answer"><p>Our headquarters is in Oshodi, Lagos, Nigeria. We serve clients across Lagos and throughout Nigeria, with delivery and project arrangements depending on the scope of work.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/cta-section') %>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %><%- include('partials/scripts') %>